00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:35.330
Now, if you've heard anything about
this show, or its infamous reputation,

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:37.560
you may be expecting me to rip it a new bollocks,

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:41.530
so allow me to surprise some of you by saying,
in some ways, I actually enjoyed this anime,

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:43.760
in the sense that it was just pure mindless fun.

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:47.000
Yes, character were typical, story predictable and completely shallow,

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:51.330
but it never tries to hide what it's trying to be, and does
exactly what it says on the tin, with the tin saying,

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:55.740
"Hot high school girls fighting hordes of zombies with
plenty of blood-wearing, skimpy school uniforms. P.S...

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:56.640
CLEAVAGE!!"

00:03:56.640 --> 00:04:00.140
This is a popcorn flick, through and through,
and makes no attempt to disguise it.

00:04:00.140 --> 00:04:02.720
The plot is nothing he haven't seen before in previous zombie flicks,

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:06.720
but it does well to portray the panic during the
rise of the zombie infestation and post-apocalypse.

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:10.190
This keep us interested in what happens and
how society breaks down in a dying world.

00:04:10.190 --> 00:04:14.250
Characters are pretty much one-dimensional and are
only really there to fill in their stereotypical roles of

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:17.530
kicking ass, flashing skin, or being fucking useless.

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:20.750
But, honestly, you don't go into a summer
blockbuster expecting Oscar material

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:23.820
and, at its best points, it's a fun and entertaining show to watch.

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:28.270
Animation is also top-notch, which is especially
evident during the very well-executed action scenes,

00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:31.530
